/target
/.claude

# Sprites and system sounds ARE tracked: `audio.rs` include_bytes! the WAVs at
# compile time, and build-wasm.sh copies the sprites into apps/host/public/.
# Without them in the repo, a clean clone cannot build the engine at all.
#
# Sample songs stay out — 83MB of chart and audio data used only for local
# testing, and nothing in the build reads them.
/assets/songs
